{# goal: Synthesize falsifiability, architecture, and essentialist evidence into one reduction candidate whose removed signals map completely to retained oracles. #}
[inference]
contract:
  input:
    inventory: object
    falsification_result: object
    architecture_result: object
    essentialist_result: object
    mode: string
  output:
    candidate: object
    signal_mapping: array
    decisions: array
    blockers: array
visibility: Public
---

[inference]
temperature = 0.1
work_effort = "high"
verbosity = "detailed"
thinking_budget = "full"

Produce one verification reduction candidate from the supplied evidence.

Inventory:
```json
{{ inventory | tojson }}
```
Falsification:
```json
{{ falsification_result | tojson }}
```
Architecture:
```json
{{ architecture_result | tojson }}
```
Essentialist gates:
```json
{{ essentialist_result | tojson }}
```
Mode: {{ mode }}

Classify each artifact RETAIN, REMOVE, MERGE, or DEFER. A removed artifact must
have every signal key mapped to a retained artifact and must have survived a
discriminating harmful-change test. Missing mappings are blockers. Select one
candidate domain only; do not trade signal loss for speed. Copy complete signal
rows from the observed graph into the candidate graph, retaining artifact IDs.
Do not invent signal rows or replace five fields with a string or ordinal.

Return JSON only:
```json
{
  "candidate": {
    "id":"",
    "domain":"",
    "removed_artifacts":[],
    "retained_artifacts":[],
    "merged_artifacts":[],
    "predicted_graph_delta":{"nodes":0,"edges":0},
    "predicted_time_delta_ms":0,
    "verification_graph":{"signal_keys":[{"artifact_id":"", "expectation_id":"", "falsifier_id":"", "oracle_kind":"", "failure_class":"", "provenance_tier":""}]}
  },
  "signal_mapping": [
    {"removed_artifact":"", "signal_key":{"expectation_id":"", "falsifier_id":"", "oracle_kind":"", "failure_class":"", "provenance_tier":""}, "retained_artifact":"", "empirical_falsifier":"", "status":"covered|missing"}
  ],
  "decisions": [
    {"artifact":"", "decision":"RETAIN|REMOVE|MERGE|DEFER", "constraint_force":"Prohibition|Guardrail|Guideline|Evidence|Hypothesis", "basis":""}
  ],
  "blockers": []
}
```